<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px',
  height: '720px',
  background: '#0A0F1E',
  padding: '40px 64px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  <Text style={{
    fontSize: 34,
    fontWeight: 'bold',
    color: '#F8FAFC',
    marginBottom: 24,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif',
  }}>
    教师端 · 学生管理与作业分发
  </Text>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    gap: 32,
    flex: 1,
    alignItems: 'stretch',
  }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 440,
      background: '#131C33',
      borderRadius: 20,
      padding: 32,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      alignItems: 'center',
      gap: 14,
      border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.2)',
    }}>
      <Box style={{
        width: 280,
        height: 72,
        background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #2563EB 100%)',
        borderRadius: 12,
        justifyContent: 'center',
        alignItems: 'center',
        gap: 12,
        flexDirection: 'row',
      }}>
        <FAIcon name='users' style={{ fill: '#F8FAFC', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>学生名单</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#D4AF37', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>↓</Text>
      <Box style={{
        width: 280,
        height: 72,
        background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.18)',
        borderRadius: 12,
        justifyContent: 'center',
        alignItems: 'center',
        border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.4)',
      }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>作业 / 考试分发</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#D4AF37', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>↓</Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{
          width: 132,
          height: 90,
          background: 'rgba(212,175,55,0.15)',
          borderRadius: 12,
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
          border: '1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4)',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC', textAlign: 'center' }}>完成率<br />统计</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          width: 132,
          height: 90,
          background: 'rgba(212,175,55,0.15)',
          borderRadius: 12,
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
          border: '1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4)',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC', textAlign: 'center' }}>DDL 自动<br />过期</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#D4AF37', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>↓</Text>
      <Box style={{
        width: 280,
        height: 72,
        background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #D4AF37 0%, #F3D27A 100%)',
        borderRadius: 12,
        justifyContent: 'center',
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A0F1E' }}>学生个人空间同源数据</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      gap: 18,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C7D0E0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        教师可为指定学生分发试卷或语言练习，设定截止时间；学生端个人空间实时同步，教师端可查看完成率与学情表现。
      </Text>
      {[
        { title: '精准分发', desc: '按学生 / 班级选择分发对象' },
        { title: 'DDL 管理', desc: '截止时间自动触发 EXPIRED 状态' },
        { title: '完成统计', desc: '待完成 / 进行中 / 已提交一目了然' },
        { title: '级联删除', desc: '删除学生同步清理作业、成绩、错题' },
      ].map((c, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{
          background: '#131C33',
          borderRadius: 14,
          padding: 18,
          flexDirection: 'row',
          alignItems: 'center',
          gap: 12,
          borderLeft: '3px solid #D4AF37',
        }}>
          <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#D4AF37', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>{c.title}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>{c.desc}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    justifyContent: 'space-between',
    marginTop: 24,
  }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>金瑞升学 · 金鹰系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>16 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
